title: 'spec-msg: optimistic V3 recovery and delivery tests'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: Add focused optimistic messaging integration tests, including runtime-cut bundles,
    joint enactment and latency measurements, and controlled availability-fault tooling. Require
    timeout observations to match finalized relay history. Avoid session waits and unused cores
    in the default catch-up fixture. Time the two-way fault so the sender can still read pending credit.
crates: []
